{% from "macros.html.jinja" import scope %}
<div {{ scope(report_view, candidate) }}>
  <h3>How this geo test isolates true ad impact</h3>
  <p>This study divides your market into matched <strong>treatment</strong> ({{ n_treatment }} regions, {{ share }} of baseline volume) and <strong>control</strong> ({{ n_control }} regions) groups whose historical conversion trends move together.</p>
  <p>{{ validation }}, so comparing the two groups over the {{ days }}-day test window isolates true incremental lift from seasonality and market-wide shifts.</p>
</div>
